WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.438
OK Jags, great win.  I am as confused as you are 

00:00:02.438 --> 00:00:04.719
But I think it has something to do 
with being outside the country

00:00:04.719 --> 00:00:06.555
So I've agreed to have our next game even further

00:00:06.555 --> 00:00:07.559
It's going to be on the moon!

00:00:07.559 --> 00:00:08.565
What? Like Warren

00:00:08.565 --> 00:00:10.055
But how will we get there? 

00:00:10.055 --> 00:00:11.647
The moon’s like a whole ‘nother PLANET!

00:00:11.647 --> 00:00:14.473
I figured out how to win two Super Bowls with Eli Manning

00:00:14.473 --> 00:00:17.169
I think I can figure out how to get a 
football team to outer space

00:00:17.169 --> 00:00:17.594
Leonard!

00:00:17.594 --> 00:00:19.866
As a human science major at LSU, 

00:00:19.866 --> 00:00:21.905
I've been tasked with designing our spaceship

00:00:21.905 --> 00:00:22.955
I present to you

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:24.329
The Bortle Rocket

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:30.140
OK Blake, the controls are based on your
awkward throwing motion

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.824
So there's only a 58 percent chance

00:00:31.824 --> 00:00:33.495
that this journey ends in a completion

00:00:33.495 --> 00:00:36.794
McCown's over there.  Why don't we ask the Jets for a ride

00:00:36.794 --> 00:00:38.142
Things are looking up for the Jets baby!

00:00:38.142 --> 00:00:39.548
I threw a touchdown!

00:00:40.531 --> 00:00:41.614
Bro down!

00:00:41.614 --> 00:00:43.686
Relax Blake. This ship is calibrated for garbage time

00:00:43.686 --> 00:00:46.125
Alright, giddyup Jags, let's do this

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:47.452
Guys? Hey guys?

00:00:47.452 --> 00:00:49.847
Wait, am I the only one on this rocketshIIIIII-

00:00:50.823 --> 00:00:51.898
Great job team!

00:00:51.898 --> 00:00:53.297
We put Bortles on the moon

00:00:53.297 --> 00:00:55.119
Now we can bring in a real QB

00:00:55.119 --> 00:00:56.474
A proven veteran

00:00:56.474 --> 00:00:58.095
Who's been to the playoffs

00:00:58.095 --> 00:00:59.035
I give you

00:00:59.035 --> 00:01:00.035
Ryan Nassib

